WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Material transitions. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Show where panels and trim meet

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Material transitions happen at real interfaces: seams, joints, seals and trim boundaries. Their placement affects assembly and visual continuity.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Follow one panel edge around a corner; note where the gap, seal and adjacent part must meet.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Interface annotation

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A view supports interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance alone.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Show where panels and trim meet
